# The Studio scaffold, and everything it generates.
#
# `bag init` writes a wallet keystore into `.studio/wallets/` and a
# `.env.local` holding WALLET_PASSWORD and provider API keys. None of that
# belongs in a repository, and an earlier scaffold was left in a temp directory
# with exactly those files in it. The project lives here so it is durable and
# ignored, rather than durable or ignored.
*
!.gitignore
